<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Activate Your Account</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%);
            padding: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.9;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }

        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #2c3e50;
        }

        .greeting strong {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #667eea;
        }

        .description {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .cta-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 35px 0;
        }

        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 14px 45px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.4);
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.6);
        }

        .info-box {
            background: #f8f9fb;
            border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .info-box strong {
            color: #667eea;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .info-box p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }

        .expiration-timer {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #fff3cd;
            border: 1px solid #ffc107;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #856404;
        }

        .expiration-timer span {
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 0 8px;
        }

        .icon {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-right: 8px;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .or-text {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 25px 0;
            color: #999;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .copy-link {
            background: #f0f2f5;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            word-break: break-all;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #2c3e50;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #f8f9fb;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        .footer-text {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #888;
            margin: 10px 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .footer-links {
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .footer-links a {
            color: #667eea;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin: 0 12px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .footer-links a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .security-note {
            background: #e8f5e9;
            border-left: 4px solid #4caf50;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #2e7d32;
        }

        .security-note strong {
            color: #1b5e20;
        }

        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: #e0e0e0;
            margin: 25px 0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .header h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }

            .cta-button {
                display: block;
                width: 100%;
                padding: 16px 20px;
            }

            .container {
                border-radius: 8px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>✓ Welcome Aboard!</h1>
            <p>Activate your account to get started</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <p class="greeting">
                Hello <strong>{{userName}}</strong>,
            </p>

            <p class="description">
                Thank you for signing up! We're excited to have you on board. To complete your registration and unlock all features, please activate your account by clicking the button below.
            </p>

            <!-- Expiration Timer -->
            <div class="expiration-timer">
                <span class="icon">⏱️</span>
                <span>This link expires in {{expirationHours}} hours</span>
                <span class="icon">⏳</span>
            </div>

            <!-- CTA Button -->
            <div class="cta-section">
                <a href="{{activationUrl}}" class="cta-button">Activate Your Account</a>
            </div>

            <!-- Or Copy Link -->
            <p class="or-text">Or copy and paste this link in your browser:</p>
            <div class="copy-link">{{activationUrl}}</div>

            <!-- Info Box -->
            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>🔐 What happens next?</strong></p>
                <p>Once activated, you'll be able to:</p>
                <p>✓ Access your account dashboard<br/>
                ✓ Set up your profile<br/>
                ✓ Explore all premium features</p>
            </div>

            <!-- Security Note -->
            <div class="security-note">
                <strong>🛡️ Security Note:</strong> This activation link is personal to you. Do not share it with anyone. If you didn't create this account, please ignore this email.
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <!-- Troubleshooting -->
            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>Having trouble?</strong></p>
                <p>If the button above doesn't work, try copying and pasting the link into your browser's address bar. If you're still having issues, contact our support team at <strong>support@example.com</strong></p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p class="footer-text">
                <strong>Activation Link Expires:</strong> {{expirationDate}}<br/>
                <strong>Email:</strong> {{userEmail}}
            </p>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="#">Help Center</a>
                <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a href="#">Terms of Service</a>
                <a href="#">Contact Us</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
